# Normalise line endings so the Dockerfiles and scripts stay runnable after a
# checkout on Linux/macOS, regardless of the committer's platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须以 CRLF 检出，否则 cmd.exe / PowerShell 解析会出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
